    "enUS": {
      "description": "As you can see, there are more pigs strewn about the valley than there are in their pens. Gorgegut has been less than an ideal farmhand, but he keeps the humans away.\r\n\r\nSome of the little ones have escaped across the river. They're still too small to be harvested out in the field so we need to return them here. Take this stick and give them a good swat! That should send them scampering back to their pens.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Young Paletusk returned",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Return 10 Young Paletusks to Na'zok's farm near Bolder'ok.",
      "title": "Drive Them Back",
      "translationMetadata": {
